  "description": "YITAMOTOR factory brand packaging, Each cover is custom-built to ensure precise compatibility with 2019-2024 Ford Ranger. Made from high-quality, commercial-grade vinyl that will not stretch, fade or crack.\nFitment\n2019-2024 Ford Ranger 5 ft Bed\nNOTE:\nPlease measure your truck bed size or contact your dealer to confirm the correct model before ordering.\nCab size does not matter as long as you have the correct model and bed size.\nFeatures\n【Precisely\nFit】Each truck tonneau cover is custom-built to ensure precise\ncompatibility with the 5' (61\") bed of 2019 2020 2021 2022 2023 2024\nford ranger.\n【Easy Installation】No tools or drilling required of truck bed cover;\nUpgraded clamps for tonneau cover with adjustable holes allow for an\neasy installation within 20 minutes; user friendly design for easy\nassembly and dis-assembly.\n【Safety First】Latch lock and adjustable tension system on the end of\nthe side rails keep the tonneau cover close tightly; sturdy clamps and\nbuckles with straps protect the cover from sliding or blowing off while\ndriving.\n【Premium Quality】Made with double layer PVC on the top, structured with\nsolid alloy in the frame, this ranger bed cover is build to last for\nyour truck.\n【All season Protection】 Features tear-resistant, high-temperature\nresistance, no matter where you are or what the weather is like, we’ve\ngot you covered.",
